# Test data vs a real send

Never put a real prospect's name, phone, or email into an example, placeholder,
test page, preview, code comment, or sample message.

## Example data in files (use these)

```
Name:   Test Person  /  Jane Doe
Email:  test@example.com
Phone:  +15555550100
Slug:   test_person
```

Test pages are `test-*.html` or `r/test_*/` and get deleted before you report done.

## If a click would open Messages on this Mac

CJ's computer is signed into his iMessage. A Send button or `sms:` link can go
out as him.

Do not click Send to verify. Read the on-page preview.

If a click is unavoidable, fill **CJ Clay** and **843-283-3409** first. Never a
prospect. Never Amy, Anna, Julz, JC, or anyone from the list.
